            <ArticleTitle>Vasectomy: benefits versus risks.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>163-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The benefits and risks of modern vasectomy are presented, including a discussion of precautions and contraindications, the incidence of specific complications and suggestions for minimizing them, and the incidence of and reasons for procedure failures. Long-term side effects, including psychological sequelae, are also discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
